ADDITIONAL NOTICE ON USE

This software reports stylistic signals in text. It is not an authorship
detector and must not be represented as one. Published false-positive rates for
AI-detection tools reach 61% on human-written English text by non-native
speakers (Liang et al., Patterns 4(7), 2023). Do not use this software, or its
output, as evidence in academic misconduct proceedings, employment decisions,
content moderation enforcement, or any other process in which a person bears a
cost for being flagged.
